 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Cohomology with support",
 "statement": "Let $X$ be a scheme, let\n$i:Z\\hookrightarrow X$ be a closed subscheme with open complement\n$j:U\\hookrightarrow X$, and let $F$ be a torsion etale sheaf on the\nsmall etale site of $X$. For\n$q\\geq0$, write $H^q_Z(X,F)$ for the $q$-th right derived functor of\nthe functor of sections with support in $Z$. The same notation is used\nfor bounded-below complexes with torsion cohomology in the\nderived categories, and on\nthe small pro-etale site for finite-torsion coefficients, with the\nfunctor of sections with support understood in the corresponding\ntopology.",
 "source": {
